# Left out of the Comfy Registry archive (comfy node publish / comfy node pack; .gitignore syntax).
# The archive is the node pack that ComfyUI-Manager unzips into custom_nodes. The full studio installs from a git checkout (INSTALL.md).
# Publish from a git checkout: outside one, comfy-cli zips every file on disk (0.1.0 shipped .ruff_cache that way).
tests/
.github/
uv.lock
.ruff_cache/
# ComfyUI-Manager runs install.py after unzipping a pack; this one is the standalone studio installer (venv, ComfyUI clone, pip, downloads).
install.py
# Build and maintenance scripts, not loaded by ComfyUI.
scripts/
# The studio's web pages and media (about 200 MB) and the docs images. No node reads them.
studio/web/
docs/
# Runs user Python through exec in a child process. The Registry standards prohibit exec, so the PSN Sandboxed Script node is left out of this archive.
psn/sandbox_runner.py
